  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pztw](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pztw) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 92.076 depth occurred on May 17 2025 6km W of San Antonio. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.7708 longitude -74.1584. It impacted 24053 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
